      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ex# 4605 ぬ of ねいらぬかのうちに is the same meaning as ない.",
      "html": "ex# 4605 ぬ of ねいらぬかのうちに is the same meaning as ない.",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "16a9ae0187143a38e78f76e3aa08887bb74fe5d35b3828864d77ce7ef9a2c927",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "This usage seems to be fairly rare - most of the references to it are from Japanese grammar sites & similar.",
      "html": "This usage seems to be fairly rare - most of the references to it are from Japanese grammar sites &amp; similar.",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "527abc43c07a8e6918354a761a038d429733ba700a800dd4ea5a17f8545f087e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "You would see this expression in written word. I don't often use this in a converation as I would bite my tongue. Instead I say, 電車のドアが開いた瞬間に、--。",
      "html": "You would see this expression in written word. I don't often use this in a converation as I would bite my tongue. Instead I say, 電車のドアが開いた瞬間に、--。",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "c404cbd485fa4965ef4dbf31374f6be8b8ad21a85bcd1e8efbae9b5fd330538e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "瞬間=しゅんかん ?",
      "html": "瞬間=しゅんかん ?",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "189a230fdafbfc129ce1ad420ba42a661100c92679bbc442a42f5c88cbf41f65",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "its usually used for a small instant of time.",
      "html": "its usually used for a small instant of time.",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "debc4616266eb6432c6d7769fa71608d75c94612e3015e0b0b79ddb4bb6bafd8",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "LIT: in the time between the doors not being open and them opening...",
      "html": "LIT: in the time between the doors not being open and them opening...",
